      "transcript_text": "I'll request an HbA1c, it'll help with diabetes control. I think blood tests makes sense here, for low sugar. Never skip meals when you take the sugar tablet, and keep glucose tablets or juice with you. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. A home sugar diary is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks.",
